(7597206, 1226274, 56502, '<td valign="top">I like the creative layout of the diptych.</td>', 'I like the creative layout of the diptych.', '2018-09-21 07:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597226, 1226269, 138630, '<td valign="top">At a quick run-through of the entries last night, this one was one of my top two.   The HDR look might be a little strong for me, but not much.  And I LOVE the two photos.  Highly effective.  Will doubtless be back for a bump.</td>', 'At a quick run-through of the entries last night, this one was one of my top two.   The HDR look might be a little strong for me, but not much.  And I LOVE the two photos.  Highly effective.  Will doubtless be back for a bump.', '2018-09-21 11:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
