(7597288, 1226080, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is great, I really like how the fruit is on display in your right hand picture and prominent, versus just being in the background with the others, it makes the whole picture not flat (if that makes sense), it really pulls your eye. Then the close up on the left. Excellent.</td>', 'This is great, I really like how the fruit is on display in your right hand picture and prominent, versus just being in the background with the others, it makes the whole picture not flat (if that makes sense), it really pulls your eye. Then the close up on the left. Excellent.', '2018-09-21 14:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
