(7597793, 1226240, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Mark. Such lovely ladies! I was your 9.</td>', 'Congratulations Mark. Such lovely ladies! I was your 9.', '2018-09-28 09:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597796, 1226288, 20608, '<td valign="top">Back with a Bang!</td>', 'Back with a Bang!', '2018-09-28 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597797, 1226243, 19825, '<td valign="top">I liked your image, and I think your strategy of having the orb the same size in both shots was pretty effective. Perhaps the images are a bit too similar. I wonder if it would have been better to taken one with a much broader depths of field, such as a good cell phone image, in which both the orb and skyline are in focus. I am surprised your score was not higher. I gave you a 7 and would likely been higher if I did not have couple of people on my Instagram feed that constantly post glass orb shots with the Chicago skyline.</td>', 'I liked your image, and I think your strategy of having the orb the same size in both shots was pretty effective. Perhaps the images are a bit too similar. I wonder if it would have been better to taken one with a much broader depths of field, such as a good cell phone image, in which both the orb and skyline are in focus. I am surprised your score was not higher. I gave you a 7 and would likely been higher if I did not have couple of people on my Instagram feed that constantly post glass orb shots with the Chicago skyline.', '2018-09-28 10:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597799, 1226080, 138630, '<td valign="top">I noticed the placement of the images and the title right off and thought both were brilliant.  Congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'I noticed the placement of the images and the title right off and thought both were brilliant.  Congrats on the top 10.', '2018-09-28 10:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597800, 1226269, 60581, '<td valign="top">nice one Marion!</td>', 'nice one Marion!', '2018-09-28 10:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597810, 1226269, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue for this wonderful tandem.  The lower portion, with it''s lovely disposition of elements and uncanny blues, is my favorite "half."</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue for this wonderful tandem.  The lower portion, with it''s lovely disposition of elements and uncanny blues, is my favorite "half."', '2018-09-28 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597811, 1226288, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the red for this handsome diptych.  I especially appreciate the sense of discovery, of what''s happening out on those pilings.</td>', 'Congratulations on the red for this handsome diptych.  I especially appreciate the sense of discovery, of what''s happening out on those pilings.', '2018-09-28 13:14:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597814, 1226317, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a high mark for this inviting seascape.  I like how even the close-up image has great depth.</td>', 'Congratulations on a high mark for this inviting seascape.  I like how even the close-up image has great depth.', '2018-09-28 13:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597815, 1226240, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the yellow for this buoyant pair of images.  Fine choice of shapes and sizes.  Also, I like how in the upper portrait the lovely woman has turned to face the camera, suffusing the diptych with intimacy.</td>', 'Congratulations on the yellow for this buoyant pair of images.  Fine choice of shapes and sizes.  Also, I like how in the upper portrait the lovely woman has turned to face the camera, suffusing the diptych with intimacy.', '2018-09-28 13:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597816, 1226269, 87808, '<td valign="top">I told you it was fantastic, huge congrats on this shot, I really enjoyed viewing it and looking at it, and I still get immense pleasure and I am not sure why.  It could be that it is so industrial, so everyday, but then boom, out comes this gorgeous blue with rings and the crosshatching of the fence and sparrows. I think it really does show everyone that beauty is hidden in everything!</td>', 'I told you it was fantastic, huge congrats on this shot, I really enjoyed viewing it and looking at it, and I still get immense pleasure and I am not sure why.  It could be that it is so industrial, so everyday, but then boom, out comes this gorgeous blue with rings and the crosshatching of the fence and sparrows. I think it really does show everyone that beauty is hidden in everything!', '2018-09-28 13:45:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597817, 1226240, 87808, '<td valign="top">Really lovely!</td>', 'Really lovely!', '2018-09-28 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597818, 1226479, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the high mark for this striking, inventive, engaging and sensational diptych.  As Mariuca said, "Moreover, the diptych can be seen as one image also."  It''s an extraordinary zipper fertile in possibility.  The lines of the jutting bars and knife-edge buildings are entrancing.  The details invite exploration.  I especially enjoy the gold and green glows emanating from some of the windows.  <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Congratulations on the high mark for this striking, inventive, engaging and sensational diptych.  As Mariuca said, "Moreover, the diptych can be seen as one image also."  It''s an extraordinary zipper fertile in possibility.  The lines of the jutting bars and knife-edge buildings are entrancing.  The details invite exploration.  I especially enjoy the gold and green glows emanating from some of the windows.  Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-09-28 13:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597819, 1226465, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely pair of realistic abstracts, as I see them.  Both are beautifully composed and utilize an impressively minimal palette.  I uncharacteristically find this architecture uplifting, no doubt greatly assisted by the artistry of the photographer, which modestly  ameliorates my trepidation about progress.  Both straightforward and playful.  Interesting edging and frame.</td>', 'Lovely pair of realistic abstracts, as I see them.  Both are beautifully composed and utilize an impressively minimal palette.  I uncharacteristically find this architecture uplifting, no doubt greatly assisted by the artistry of the photographer, which modestly  ameliorates my trepidation about progress.  Both straightforward and playful.  Interesting edging and frame.', '2018-09-28 14:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597825, 1226479, 100831, '<td valign="top">This is amazing.</td>', 'This is amazing.', '2018-09-28 16:23:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597826, 1226240, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love this image..  such joy.  <a href="//nationalmuseumofmexicanart.org/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Mexican Art is colorful too</a></td>', 'Love this image..  such joy.  Mexican Art is colorful too', '2018-09-28 16:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
